Excalibur while exploring, for the added searching and it is good
enough for most opponents.  But encounter a balrog or other
nasty and use "x" to switch to Greyswandir or Frost Bane.

For a chaotic character including wizards, they get Stormy when
crowned.  Crowning can be viewed as notice that you've spent
enough time at an altar trying for nice artifacts and it's time
to descend depper into the dungeon.  Anyways, once a chaotic
Wizard has MB and Stormy, it's time to use Stormy enough to
max out (board/rune)sword skill, then start using it as an
alternate with MB.  MB during most exploration, encounter
nasty, "x", whack with Stormy.  BTW, this is why having MR
redundantly and not just from MB is a very good idea.

